":"/meta/trafficLights"},{"country":"colombia","country_name":"Colombia","image":"geohints/trafficLights/light_73.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/trafficLights/light_73.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/nZQQqaNkhbxBaEBT7","source_page":"/meta/trafficLights"},{"country":"ecuador","country_name":"Ecuador","image":"geohints/trafficLights/light_110.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/trafficLights/light_110.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/PdSctfjsyLdnKh959","source_page":"/meta/trafficLights"},{"country":"ecuador","country_name":"Ecuador","image":"geohints/trafficLights/light_108.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/trafficLights/light_108.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/7FBBPz6wbWgYtQ2r5","source_page":"/meta/trafficLights"},{"country":"ecuador","country_name":"Ecuador","image":"geohints/trafficLights/light_109.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/trafficLights/light_109.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/yzY9C6rnQ2mmoNha9","source_page":"/meta/trafficLights"},{"country":"paraguay","country_name":"Paraguay","image":"geohints/trafficLights/light_171.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/trafficLights/light_171.jpg","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/UHEeYPEC3AdCMSwy7","source_page":"/meta/trafficLights"},{"country":"paraguay","country_name":"Paraguay","image":"geohints/trafficLights/light_172.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/trafficLights/light_172.jpg","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/AwAiKiCNQyzrLeRW7","source_page":"/meta/trafficLights"},{"country":"peru","country_name":"Peru","image":"geohints/trafficLights/light_111.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/trafficLights/light_111.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/iimwwHbVcpit1cHR7","source_page":"/meta/trafficLights"},{"country":"peru","country_name":"Peru","image":"geohints/trafficLights/light_112.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/trafficLights/light_112.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/MH8LY2oEA2oyfdoA9","source_page":"/meta/trafficLights"},{"country":"uruguay","country_name":"Uruguay","image":"geohints/trafficLights/light_74.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/trafficLights/light_74.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/HChPArPeeEWbGTD8A","source_page":"/meta/trafficLights"}],"tips":[{"id":"npN9","text":["Traffic lights are most often supported by black-and-yellow or red-and-white **striped poles**.","NOTE: The regional differences are discussed in Step 2."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/belgium/Ontwerp_zonder_titel_12.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/fCWKiPpJJfNcsqAeA","clues":["utility_poles","traffic_lights"],"important":false,"tagged":true,"country":"belgium","country_name":"Belgium"},{"id":"rJaC","text":["Traffic lights held up by **yellow-and-black** poles are unique to Flanders. In contrast, Wallonia and Brussels frequently use a **red-and-white** design."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/belgium/striped_posts_v2.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/YZsLvD7jARV44N618","clues":["utility_poles","traffic_lights"],"important":false,"tagged":true,"country":"belgium","country_name":"Belgium"},{"id":"ffan","text":["Traffic lights in Rijeka are held up by **long blue poles** that extend out over the road. These are exclusive to the city."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/croatia/long_bois.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/HNyMVsjf2FA54gPt5","clues":["utility_poles","traffic_lights"],"important":false,"tagged":true,"country":"croatia","country_name":"Croatia"},{"id":"EOjT","text":["**Yellow traffic light poles** are typically found in the city of Santiago de los Caballeros.","NOTE: This only applies to traffic light poles - yellow signposts are common in both cities."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/dominican-republic/Santiago_de_los_Caballeros_Traffic_Light_Poles.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/WWsdZLcU1gcUNKVp8","clues":["utility_poles","traffic_lights","signs"],"important":false,"tagged":true,"country":"dominican republic","country_name":"Dominican Republic"},{"id":"ISiU","text":["Traffic lights and pedestrian crossing poles in Johannesburg are encircled by three strips of **reflective tape**."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/south-africa/Joburg_reflective_tape.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/kwCwmUU86y81Cm3bA","clues":["utility_poles","traffic_lights"],"important":false,"tagged":true,"country":"south africa","country_name":"South Africa"},{"id":"ZZKi","text":["Traffic lights with a **white outline** around the frame are found in the eastern and western states of WA, QLD, NSW, ACT and Tas. Traffic lights without a border are found in the remaining, central states."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/australia/aaaa.webp","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/@-31.9491158,115.8644931,3a,15y,178.33h,95.2t/data=!3m7!1e1!3m5!1sXyeYko8QaYAkLTpWlprFfQ!2e0!5s20210301T000000!7i16384!8i8192","clues":["traffic_lights"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"australia","country_name":"Australia"},{"id":"YPX7","text":["**White and black** striped traffic light posts can be seen in urban areas."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/curacao/image__282_29.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/52UqrVVx2iqovBds7","clues":["traffic_lights"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"curacao","country_name":"Curaçao"},{"id":"F8Gs","text":["Iceland’s street signs use a white background and black text. They often have a **thin metal rim** and are attached to lampposts or traffic lights."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/iceland/Screenshot__281163_29.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/yqxLLkuRyFTb9mkn9","clues":["traffic_lights","signs"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"iceland","country_name":"Iceland"},{"id":"IQ4Z","text":["Vertical traffic lights can be found in Hokkaido, and along the northwestern coast. The usual [horizontal traffic lights](https://goo.gl/maps/wL83475gQqPcevLW9) can be found everywhere else."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/japan/60.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/yEHadQiwBBJpUH9s6","clues":["traffic_lights"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"japan","country_name":"Japan"},{"id":"8cvB","text":["Peru is the only South American country to use **black-and-white** striped signposts. In some areas, [black-and-yellow](https://goo.gl/maps/4X8W8dd1mmrbhVLH7) signposts can be seen.","NOTE: Uruguay sometimes uses black-and-white posts for its traffic lights, but not for road signs."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/peru/1.signpost.webp","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/@-13.498914,-72.4834524,3a,22.7y,317.17h,79.87t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1s20VsX1gefo0_nUDl9Accvg!2e0!7i16384!8i8192?entry=ttu","clues":["traffic_lights","signs"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"peru","country_name":"Peru"},{"id":"hHxa","text":["Almost all Singaporean traffic lights follow this design and are supported by a curved **sheet of metal** containing several **holes**."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/singapore/trafficlight.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/7Km9vca4Vp9bjmQb7","clues":["traffic_lights"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"singapore","country_name":"Singapore"},{"id":"cfRa","text":["**Three yellow stripes** can be found on signposts and street lamps in Karlstad as well as on traffic lights in [Stockholm](https://maps.app.goo.gl/LWkfkK444PC1CAMy5)."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/sweden/karlstadsgul.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/g7C8LUiZsVdFMnHcA","clues":["traffic_lights","signs"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"sweden","country_name":"Sweden"}],"gallery_count":164,"tip_count":12}